de prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025, the middle ran 191% of normal in April to May and 56% in November to December. In 2026, the middle has run 46% in February to March so far, and the preliminary estimate on grid 18735 for August to September 2026 is 27.4. Grid 18437 had its driest year in 1963 at 54%.</p>"}
